<title>USA: TVA shuts Watts Bar nuke for maintenance.</title>
<headline>TVA shuts Watts Bar nuke for maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tennessee Valley Authority's (TVA) 1,170 megawatt Watts Bar nuclear power plant in Spring City, Tenn. was shut over the weekend for a maintenance outage, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission said.</p>
<p>The unit was expected to return to service on October 26, the NRC said Monday in its daily plant status report.  </p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- New York Power Desk 212-859-1627</p>
</text>
